 haar favoriete winkel verandert dat: de onaangename hoofdpersoon van zijn nieuwe boek zou op haar gebaseerd zijn. Vanaf dat moment raakt haar overtuiging dat zij haar man en zichzelf kent aan het wankelen. Een krantenknipsel over een vermiste vrouw geeft haar achterdocht een nieuwe richting. Haar pogingen zijn geheimen te ontrafelen beginnen het hele huishouden te beïnvloeden.","work_id":987146055,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work5847 Mrs. March / Virginia Feito and exact Dutch Mevrouw March 9789044364521 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-027.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435421182"],"reference":"work:5847","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-027.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL24212743W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p435421182"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789044364521","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15123943,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60149936M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"origina